BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 491.528 Td (\(test version\) from cheap fabric first and adjust before cutting your real fabric.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 468.850 Td (3. Cut every piece as labelled: pieces marked 'on fold' on the fabric fold, 'cut 2' twice, sleeves twice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 446.173 Td (4. Staystitch the neckline just inside the seam line so it doesn't stretch while you work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 423.496 Td (5. Sew all darts first, pressing toward the center.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 400.819 Td (6. Sew the bodice shoulder seams and press them open.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 378.142 Td (7. Prepare the neckline bias strip: join the ends as needed and press it in half lengthwise along the marked) Tj ET
