BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 339.591 Td (8. Bind the neckline with the bias strip, right sides together and raw edges even, leaving the last 2 cm free at) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 323.717 Td (each center back edge \(the zipper goes there later\). Ease the strip gently around the curves. Trim to 6 mm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 307.843 Td (turn the folded edge to the inside and topstitch or slipstitch it down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 285.165 Td (9. Sew the bodice side seams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 262.488 Td (10. Sew the skirt seams \(leave the center back seam open where the zipper will go\), then join bodice to skirt at) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 246.614 Td (the waist seam, matching side seams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 223.937 Td (11. Insert an invisible zipper in the center back through bodice and skirt: install the zipper BEFORE closing the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 208.063 Td (seam below it, then close the rest of the seam.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 185.386 Td (12. Fold the free binding ends back over the zipper tape and hand-tack them down so the edge sits clean) Tj ET
